<title>GERMANY: German July producer prices unch mth/mth.</title>
<headline>German July producer prices unch mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PAN GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES   July 96     June 96     July 95</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    unch	  -0.2	   unch</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.8	  -0.8	   +2.0</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.3	 103.3	  104.1</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    unch	  -0.2	   -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    -0.9	  -1.0	   +1.9</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  102.9	 102.9	  103.8</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.4	  unch	   -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.7	  +1.2	   +1.3</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  108.5	 108.1	  106.7</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
